Yeeps Lettering
Yeeps Lettering is a lightweight browser-based lettering generator that creates bold, chunky, sticker-style text with a navy outline, lavender 3D depth, and decorative pins. It is designed for quick, playful logo and wordmark creation with instant visual feedback.

This project is intentionally simple: it is a single HTML file with embedded CSS and JavaScript, so there is no install step, build process, or dependency management required.

Features
Custom main text and optional secondary line
Multiple font choices
Adjustable chunky shape, depth, outline thickness, and tracking
Optional pin decorations with placement controls
Preset color combinations and custom color pickers
Dark and light theme support
Transparent, white, dark navy, or custom background options
Export as a PNG file or copy the artwork to the clipboard
No external build tooling or framework required
Project Structure
index.html — the complete app, including markup, styling, and JavaScript logic
How to Use
Open index.html in a web browser.
Enter your desired main text and optional small line.
Adjust the appearance settings such as font, chunkiness, depth, thickness, colors, and pins.
Preview the result in the live canvas area.
Click Save PNG to download the generated artwork.
Alternatively, click Copy image to copy it to your clipboard.
