Notes
The app is best suited for creating bold, stylized text graphics and sticker-like lettering.
It runs entirely in the browser and does not require any package installation.
The repository currently contains one primary frontend page and no formal project build pipeline.
Example
The default example is configured with stylized text similar to SPIDERYEEP12_VR, but you can replace it with any phrase or word you want.

